WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.550
A recurrence check is a separate follow-up ticket linked to the original repair.

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:09.700
Open the day five check and compare the original ticket number and equipment before testing.

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:12.560
If the fault is back, choose Fault returned.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:15.580
Describe what failed again and under what conditions.

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:18.370
Select Reopen with the original ticket number.

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:22.810
Open the original from the check and verify that the repair is back with its owner.

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:24.190
Don't raise a duplicate.
